(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers construction of pump house with structural steel roof) Tj T*
(and electrical works complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(3.1 Exposure condition shall be considered as severe for all members.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: CONCRETE AND REINFORCEMENT) Tj T*
(4.1 Design and construction of RCC shall be in accordance with IS 456:2000.) Tj T*
(4.2 Grade of concrete for all structural members shall be M 30.) Tj T*
(4.3 Clear cover to main reinforcement shall be 45mm for all members.) Tj T*
(4.4 Maximum free water cement ratio shall be 0.45. Cement content shall not be) Tj T*
(less than 320 kg/m³ of concrete.) Tj T*
(4.5 OPC 43 grade cement as per IS 269:2015 shall be used.) Tj T*
(4.6 Aggregates shall comply with the requirements of IS 383:2016.) Tj T*
(4.7 High strength deformed bars of grade Fe 500D as per IS 1786:2008 shall be) Tj T*
(used. Mix design shall be carried out in accordance with IS 10262:2019.) Tj T*
(4.8 Concrete shall be kept continuously moist for at least 10 days. Compaction) Tj T*
(shall be done by immersion vibrators.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART E — STRUCTURAL STEEL WORK) Tj T*
(5.1 Rolled steel sections shall be E250 grade as per IS 2062:2011.) Tj T*
(5.2 Steel surfaces shall be painted with red oxide primer and two finishing) Tj T*
() Tj T*
