(PART F — INTERNAL WIRING AND EARTHING) Tj T*
(6.1 The internal wiring installation shall comply with IS 732:2019.) Tj T*
(6.2 Earthing arrangement of the installation shall be TN-S system.) Tj T*
(6.3 All wiring shall be drawn through heavy gauge PVC conduits recessed in) Tj T*
(walls.) Tj T*
(6.4 Building wires shall be 450/750 V grade PVC insulated multistrand copper) Tj T*
(conductor as per IS 694:2010. Minimum conductor size shall be 1.5 mm² for) Tj T*
(lighting points and 4 mm² for power points.) Tj T*
(6.5 MCBs shall be C-curve, as per IS/IEC 60898-1, with rated short circuit) Tj T*
(capacity of 10 kA.) Tj T*
(6.6 Final circuit MCBs shall be rated between 6 Amp and 32 Amp.) Tj T*
(6.7 Socket outlet circuits shall be protected by 30 mA RCCBs conforming to IS) Tj T*
(12640 \(Part 1\). The earthing system shall be designed and installed as per IS) Tj T*
(3043:2018.) Tj T*
(6.8 Main distribution board shall be earthed through two separate pipe earth) Tj T*
(electrodes.) Tj T*
(6.9 Combined resistance of the earthing system shall be less than 1 Ohm.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7 TESTS AND INSPECTION) Tj T*
(7.1 Cube tests for compressive strength shall be done in accordance with IS 516) Tj T*
(\(Part 1/Sec 1\):2021.) Tj T*
(7.2 Structural steel shall be accompanied by mill test certificates from the) Tj T*
(producer.) Tj T*
(7.3 Samples of wires shall be tested as per IS 10810 at the manufacturer's) Tj T*
(works.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
